o generate (https://www.statista.com/outlook/cmo/beauty-personal-care/fragr=
ances/worldwide?srsltid=3DAfmBOopOzi-th3-LJdVXQJTy4UgXQ2_4dZnrlwQ7b7ssyxQuF=
