1W3MPKsw3RFQ_xf8TzdpY04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data=
-hs-link-id-v2=3D"G12GN+qq" target=3D"_blank">created</a> in a German lab i=
n the 1870s =E2=80=94 but they=E2=80=99re trending in a big way.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And one of the possible drivers behind the tr=
end is the growing popularity of GLP-1 medications.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Makes scent=
s&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">While medications such as Ozempic, Wegovy, an=
d Mounjaro suppress users=E2=80=99 appetites, they could potentially <a hre=
f=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VW8HjP6B5Rp4VxZRKF3m=
Fx3sW4xGMq_5HFGXrN6crjp82-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3pXW6Xdgk43HWTW1W3PMcVY6V87NkW7K_rrx=
