p;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Both industries are growing:&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">One in eight American adults <a href=3D"https://media.=
