 teen spirit&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Per usual, it=E2=80=99s the youngest customer=
s driving the trend with their spending power.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And they=E2=80=99re doing so on =E2=80=9CPerf=
